---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-ink-100 bg-ink-950 text-ink-300">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 py-14 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <img src="/images/datafore-logo.png" alt="Datafore" class="h-8 w-auto brightness-0 invert" />
        <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Datafore</span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Datafore is building purpose-made analytics for allied health clinics, starting in British Columbia — turning
        scheduling, billing, and outcomes data into clear, day-to-day decisions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white">Explore</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/platform/" class="hover:text-white">Platform</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-white">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-white">Insights</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-white">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white">Get in touch</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="mailto:info@datafore.ca" class="hover:text-white">info@datafore.ca</a></li>
        <li><a href="tel:+17787001733" class="hover:text-white">+1 778 700 1733</a></li>
        <li>4353 Halifax Street<br />Burnaby, BC, Canada</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-ink-800">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-6 py-6 text-xs text-ink-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; {year} Datafore Analytics Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-white">Privacy Policy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
